# vvaharness/rules/cwe.py

CWE identifier normalization, the weakness-equivalence relation that Stage 4 fan-out, Stage 5 and Stage 7 collapse, and Stage 5 re-anchoring use to decide whether two findings name the same weakness, and the OWASP 2025 label map used by the deterministic detectors.

